<figure class="bb-harness-overview" aria-label="The Suites Blackbox behavioral verification model">
  <div class="bb-harness-overview__viewport">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 960 270"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="bb-harness-title bb-harness-desc"
      font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif"
    >
      <title id="bb-harness-title">The Suites Blackbox behavioral verification model</title>
      <desc id="bb-harness-desc">Human-approved intent enters Suites Blackbox. Blackbox executes a system flow, observes runtime effects, and returns a deterministic verdict. The coding agent repairs the implementation without redefining the accepted intent.</desc>
      <defs>
        <marker
          id="bb-harness-arrow"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10"
          refX="8"
          refY="5"
          markerWidth="7"
          markerHeight="7"
          orient="auto"
        >
          <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#94a3b8"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <rect x="8" y="8" width="944" height="254" rx="10" fill="#0b1120" stroke="#334155"></rect>

      <text x="36" y="48" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="20" font-weight="800">Behavioral verification for agentic software engineering</text>

      <rect x="44" y="86" width="210" height="118" rx="8" fill="#172554" stroke="#60a5fa"></rect>
      <text x="149" y="122" text-anchor="middle" fill="#eff6ff" font-size="15" font-weight="800">Human-approved intent</text>
      <text x="149" y="151" text-anchor="middle" fill="#bfdbfe" font-size="12">defines accepted behavior</text>
      <text x="149" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#93c5fd" font-size="11" font-weight="700">THE FIXED TARGET</text>

      <line x1="254" y1="145" x2="310" y2="145" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#bb-harness-arrow)"></line>

      <rect x="320" y="66" width="320" height="158" rx="8" fill="#111827" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="2"></rect>
      <text x="480" y="104" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fef3c7" font-size="17" font-weight="800">Suites Blackbox</text>
      <text x="480" y="134" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="14">executes the system flow</text>
      <line x1="390" y1="152" x2="570" y2="152" stroke="#475569"></line>
      <text x="480" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#bbf7d0" font-size="14">observes runtime effects</text>
      <text x="480" y="204" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="11">computes a deterministic verdict</text>

      <line x1="640" y1="145" x2="696" y2="145" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#bb-harness-arrow)"></line>
      <text x="668" y="128" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fde68a" font-size="10" font-weight="700">VERDICT</text>

      <rect x="706" y="86" width="210" height="118" rx="8" fill="#1f2937" stroke="#c084fc"></rect>
      <text x="811" y="122" text-anchor="middle" fill="#faf5ff" font-size="15" font-weight="800">Coding agent</text>
      <text x="811" y="151" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9d5ff" font-size="12">repairs the implementation</text>
      <text x="811" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fda4af" font-size="11" font-weight="700">CANNOT REDEFINE INTENT</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Blackbox turns accepted behavior and runtime observation into a deterministic repair signal without giving the coding agent control over the target.</figcaption>
</figure>

